    "faq-a1": "NUTRIX leverages long-range LoRaWAN and sub-GHz mesh radio protocols. Sensor probes can transmit telemetry across 5 to 12 kilometres to a solar-powered central gateway without requiring cellular SIM cards on individual probes.",
